{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "伊藤理々杏です( * ॑˘ ॑* )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "42枚目シングルアンダー曲"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「フォルテシモ」のMVが公開されましたー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見てくださいましたか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても爽やかなメロディで歌っていて、踊っていて凄く楽しい！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MV撮影中色々と写真撮れたので特別に皆さんにおすそ分け…。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特別ですよ！！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobij04h2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛い可愛いあーや。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あーやが座長のアンダラ絶対最高最強！楽しみだね"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/moblQnDKV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カメラを向けるとポーズを決めてくれるみんなが愛おしくてたまらない！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mob5omfvE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛い寝方すぎて思わず撮ってしまいました。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "凄く忙しい中いつも頑張っている6期ちゃんすごいよー！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobUW8JdJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回お隣の2人。なんか見てるだけで癒されるんですよね可愛い！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなとってもとっても可愛いでしょ？"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山MV見てくださいねー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はこの辺で！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ではではまたまたー！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobFMm8FM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いぇい"}], "source": "official"}